{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/pulls/2536","id":4723065292,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQQhC388AAAABGYRBzA","html_url":"https://github.com/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/pull/2536","diff_url":"https://github.com/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/pull/2536.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/pull/2536.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/issues/2536","number":2536,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(HIGH): deterministic tipping-point coaching from the current Run","user":{"login":"Talchain","id":30796128,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzk2MTI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30796128?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain","html_url":"https://github.com/Talchain","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The existing “What would change” press can fall through to ordinary generation when analysis is stale or provides no crossing. It now answers from the selected current Run’s typed tipping point, with the exact supplied factor, threshold, direction and unit. The positive says: “Pro plan price is a factor that could change this: the comparison could change if it rises above 55.76 GBP/month.”\n\nThe existing Explain binding guard supplies Run identity. A fresh final canonical read refuses a competing or stale Run; retries of this unbound question reconstruct today’s fact instead of replaying an older threshold. This terminal path makes no model or mutation call. The RC checker accepts optional grounded elaboration and falls back to the same deterministic sentence on altered facts. The selector retains its existing priority/order, and the same fact can support a neutral coaching row without EVPPI or winner naming; that row requires the existing bound Run key.\n\nRefreshed onto served staging `aff2be2c8a80e393bb4bb28a506992c1ff314758` after #2531 landed. Current head `097f432b64d98fc447f32344ff2efa97a4d05856` merges that baseline without rewriting published history. The 14-file coaching patch is byte-identical to the independently HIGH-reviewed `05e87551` → `a7fd1164` increment (SHA256 `6f19c9dd389c6326b6ade50f7049ba86cc8396a290c603c02acb7a534434ab54`); both coaching commits are unchanged in the path-filtered range-diff. The parent fact diff is excluded. PTL's current sequence conveyed by Delivery is coaching next, SCI-CHANGE #2522's competing handler waits, then Shared Data refreshes once; one handler owns this static question. Context P0 retains `agent-capabilities.ts` follow-up projection, Shared Data retains permissions/currentness, and the separately documented WC-only policy amendment retains the original programme spec SHA and acceptance fixture. Fresh-head Required CI and independent baseline-delta review remain landing gates; existing HARNESS/Context policy handoff is #2521 comment5964159584.\n\nValidation: focused actual-route positive/no-signal/withheld/stale/competing-Run/cold-read/retry tests, original RC/method/guidance regressions, typecheck and changed-seam lint. Five coaching mutants killed: unchecked elaboration, assumed currentness, cached final read, competing Run reuse and stored-threshold replay. Wrong-factor/threshold/direction controls remain. Exact-head Required CI is the full gate.\n\nBaseline-refresh validation at097f432b:286/10 local focused rows ran green and changed-seam lint passed, but the normal typecheck preflight correctly refused this capacity-held checkout's installed schemas0.73 versus newly served baseline's pinned0.74. The local run is therefore diagnostic evidence, not proof of the refreshed dependency contract. No guard bypass or installation was used; fresh remote Required CI installs the exact pinned baseline and must pass before landing. Previous a7fd1164 had all Required gates green; those gates do not transfer to the refreshed head.\n\nNo schema/PLoT/keep-list/status transport, new permission rule, VOI actions or selector reprioritisation. The existing factor editor’s explicit review door is under journey verification; further action/UI work is conditional on an observed blocker. Source/contract evidence only: served edit→stale→rerun→cold-reload acceptance is outstanding. The 127-row science validation is inherited. VOI is scientifically available; a product-positive case is not currently demonstrated on the served model shape.\n","created_at":"2026-10-03T01:05:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T02:22:38Z","closed_at":"2026-10-03T02:22:38Z","merged_at":"2026-10-03T02:22:38Z","merge_commit_sha":"895dd7778cc10c38b33fa2ce93091fb88fd50df8","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/pulls/2536/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/pulls/2536/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/issues/2536/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/statuses/097f432b64d98fc447f32344ff2efa97a4d05856","head":{"label":"Talchain:sci-hero/deterministic-tipping-point-coach